            "target_entity_type": "SimulationType",
            "paragraph": "Two millennial integrations with the ECHO-G model were conducted: a 1000-year control simulation (CTL) which was generated using fixed external (annually cycling) forcing set to the present-day values (Zorita et al. 2003) and a forced run, named ERIK, covering the period 1000\u20131990, which is forced by three external forcing factors (Gonzalez-Rouco et al. 2003; von Storch et al. 2004; Zorita et al. 2005): solar variability (Crowley 2000), greenhouse gas (GHG) concentrations in the atmosphere including CO2 and CH4 (Blunier et al. 1995; Etheridge et al. 1996) and the effective radiative effects from stratospheric volcanic aerosols (Crowley 2000) for the period 1000-1990 AD (Fig. 1).",
